-- MAGIC %md-sandbox
-- MAGIC ## B. Implementing Enterprise Catalog Strategy
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC A well-designed catalog naming strategy supports Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) processes while providing clear boundaries between business units and data domains. Common enterprise patterns include environment-based catalogs (dev/staging/prod) and business unit catalogs with shared governance policies.
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC In this exercise, we apply our knowledge of catalogs to set up a namespace that satisfies the requirements below:
-- MAGIC
