-- MAGIC   <span style="font-size: 24px;">ℹ️</span>
-- MAGIC   <div>
-- MAGIC     The privileges we set here constitute a minimal, safe set that provides "all" capabilities. With this privilege set, users will be able to:
-- MAGIC     <ul>
-- MAGIC       <li>Create new schemas and share those schemas with others through permission grants</li>
-- MAGIC       <li>Traverse into objects that have been shared by their owners (via permission grants)</li>
-- MAGIC     </ul>
-- MAGIC     While it's tempting to apply the <code>ALL PRIVILEGES</code> option here, doing so would grant considerable latitude over all current and future objects created within that catalog, and is typically not what most organizations would want.
