-- MAGIC ### B3. Recap
-- MAGIC
-- MAGIC In this section, we created a subset of a typical enterprise catalog structure, and configured the external locations you created earlier to direct managed table/volume data from those catalogs to external storage. While some catalogs use the default metastore storage location, the two catalogs (`eng_prd` and `fin_prd`) store their managed data in external cloud storage, giving you a high degree of control over the physical topology of your data warehouse.
